OL,3,ASeventeen dead and hundreds unaccounted
OL,4,Afor as flash flood hits Nepal-Tibet
OL,5,Aborder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 17 people have been killed and
OL,8,Fnearly 400 others are unaccounted for
OL,9,Fafter a flash flood and mudslide along
OL,10,Fthe Nepal-Tibet border washed away
OL,11,Fvillages and damaged roads and
OL,12,Finfrastructure.
OL,14,FThe flood hit early on Wednesday in
OL,15,FRasuwa, just north of Nepal's capital
OL,16,FKathmandu, with preliminary information
OL,17,Fsuggesting it was caused by an
OL,18,Fearthquake triggering an avalanche with
OL,19,Fmelted snow pouring into the Bhote
OL,20,FKoshi river.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
